    "line": 22,
    "message": "NOT IN subquery may return empty results if subquery contains NULL values",
    "suggestion": "Replace with NOT EXISTS which handles NULLs correctly",
    "severity": "error",
    "confidence": 0.85
  }
]
```

If no issues found, return: []
